>On a related topic, does anybody know how to erase bones files on the
>Macintosh version of Nethack?  I used to play on the IBM (ascended a
>Barbarian, a Tourist, and a Healer using major cheating with the
>latter), and I don't like bones levels much.  Too much stuff at once,
>and they can make the game a bit on the easy side.  I got into the
